patch_translations.source:
Masses of soul energy created by a near extinct group of races known as the Aurorans, these attempt at creating deities are ^orange;usually^reset; a rather laid back people, even while on the brink of war.

  ^orange;Diet^reset;: Carnivore

^orange;Perks^reset;:
  Health x^green;1.05^reset;, Energy x^green;1.25^reset;,
  +^green;5^reset;% Speed, +^green;10^reset;% Jump
  Fall Damage x^green;0.75^reset;
  ^green;Resist^reset;: +^green;10^reset;% Physical, +^green;15^reset;% Electric, +^green;5^reset;% Cosmic
  -^green;20^reset;% Hunger Drain^reset;
  ^cyan;Immune^reset;: Electrified

^orange;Environment^reset;:
  Irradiated: Energy x^red;0.9^reset;, Damage x^red;0.95^reset;
  Lush, Forest, and Jungle: Health/Energy/Damage x^green;1.2^reset;

^orange;Weapons^reset;:
  Bows: Damage x^green;1.15^reset;
  Broadsword, Shortsword, Dagger, Spear, Chakram: Damage x^green;1.1^reset;
  Perfect Block: Stacking Power Bonus

^red;Weaknesses^reset;:
  Defense x^red;0.9^reset;
  ^red;Resist^reset;: -^red;10^reset;% Ice and Radiation

