Meow. Space-cats with a funky culture and quirky language. Agility is their forte, and their claws and predatory instincts give them an edge in combat.

  ^orange;Diet^reset;: Carnivore

^orange;Perks^reset;:
  Fall Damage x^green;0.75^reset;
  +^green;25^reset;% Jump, +^green;6^reset;% Speed
  ^green;Resist^reset;: +^green;40^reset;% Shadow
  Tech: ^green;Hunter's Claw^reset;
  Damage x^green;1.05^reset;

^orange;Environment^reset;:
  Jungle, Rainforest, Alien, Proto, And Primeval biomes: Defense x^green;1.05^reset; and Energy x^green;1.1^reset;

^orange;Weapons^reset;:
  Fist: Damage x^green;1.12^reset;
