Enemies-turned-allies of the Hylotl, these massive otters can prove a formidable opponent in the water, though they aren't to be trifled with on land, either.

  ^orange;Diet^reset;: Semi-Carnivore. Fruits don't harm you, but other plant foods will.
^orange;Perks^reset;:
  (Built-In) ^orange;Large Profile^reset; (5 blocks tall). If you get stuck, you can hold the tech key to forcefully untransform.
  Health x^green;1.2^reset;, Damage x^green;1.1^reset;
  +^green;2000^reset; Breath, +^green;75^reset; breath regen
  Max Food x^green;1.5^reset;
  ^cyan;Swim Boost 2^reset;
  ^cyan;Immune^reset;: Wet

^orange;Environment^reset;:
  x^cyan;1.1^reset;, x^blue;1.15^reset; or x^indigo;1.1^reset; additional Damage and Energy and ^cyan;drop the ^blue;speed penalty^reset; or ^indigo;gain an additional +5% speed^reset; in ^cyan;watery^reset;, ^blue;riverine^reset;, or ^indigo;oceanic^reset; biomes.
  x^orange;0.9^reset;% or x^red;0.8^reset;% Damage and Energy, and gain an additional ^red;5^reset;% slow in ^orange;arid^reset; or ^red;active volcanic^reset; biomes.

^orange;Weapons^reset;:
  Fists: Damage x^green;1.1^reset;, +3% Crit Chance
  Shortspears: Damage and Defense x^green;1.1^reset;
  Quarterstaves and Spears: Damage and Defense x^green;1.2^reset;

^red;Weaknesses^reset;:
  +^red;100^reset;% Hunger Drain
  Fall Damage x^red;1.15^reset;
  Energy x^red;0.8^reset;

