Adorable hybrid glowing space raptors with wings. Though they have a disputed, potentially nonexistant origin, they share traits with both Novakids and Avalis, and they are deadly with heavy weapons.

  ^orange;Diet^reset;: Omnivore

^orange;Perks^reset;:
  Glow in the Dark
  +^green;12^reset;% Speed +^green;15^reset;% Jump, Energy x^green;1.05^reset;,
  ^green;Resist^reset;: +^green;25^reset;% Ice & Fire, +^green;40^reset;% Radioactive, +^green;5^reset;% Knockback
  Fall Damage x^green;0.3^reset;
  Tech: ^green;Avali Glide^reset;
  ^cyan;Immune^reset;: Snow, Ice, Radiation Burn, Mild Cold.

^orange;Environment^reset;:
  High winds grant additional agility
  ^green;Radioactive^reset; biomes: Energy & Health x^green;1.15^reset;
  ^green;Regenerate^reset; from sunlight when fed. +^green;20^reset;% E. Regen.
  Night regen ^red;consumes food^reset; and Energy x^red;0.75^reset;

^orange;Weapons^reset;:
  Airborn Damage x^green;1.1^reset;
  Energy: Damage x^green;1.12^reset;
  Grenade Launcher: +^green;20^reset;% Crit Damage
  Sniper: +^green;2^reset;% Crit Chance and +^green;10^reset;% Crit Damage

^red;Weaknesses^reset;:
  ^red;Resist^reset;: -^red;50^reset;% Shadow, -^red;10^reset;% Physical, -^red;15^reset;% Electrical
  Health x^red;0.95^reset;

